      "writtenOn": "2023-03-28T17:21:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does it work if you use `x86_64-pc-linux-gnu-ld` instead of `x86_64-pc-linux-gnu-ld.bfd.real`?\n\nIt looks like you removed the `CMAKE_LINKER`, but you could try something like:\n\n```\nset(CMAKE_LINKER \"${CROSS_COMPILE}ld.lld\")\nif (\"${CC_NAME}\" STREQUAL gcc)\nset(CMAKE_LINKER \"${CROSS_COMPILE}ld\")\nendif\n```\n\n[Reference](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/chromiumos-overlay/profiles/base/profile.bashrc;l\u003d596-612;drc\u003da10880c6d65936f1a605581215f1c3f1a0fddda7)",
      "parentUuid": "5455ef69_e455b801",
      "range": {
